All current Surface Laptops are finished entirely in metal or alloy, or carbon fiber materials to reduce the weight of the machine. Each line exudes meticulousness, bringing a sense of luxury to the user.
If the Surface is defective, it must be sent to the US for warranty, the warranty period is quite long, the fastest is 3 weeks and the latest is about 4 weeks. In addition, in some stores, the warranty fee is paid by the buyer, some pay 50%, 100%, so you should ask this clearly before buying the device to use.
Because this is a high-end product line, Surface accessories and components are not cheap. However, component failures are also very rare, but you should ask about the warranty policy before buying.
This is a brand from China. With nearly 35 years of establishment and operation, this brand has been present in over 160 countries around the world and is considered the largest computer supplier in the world.
Lenovo IdeaPad: Specialized for office, study. IdeaPad has a slim and lightweight design that is extremely convenient to bring to school and work every day.
Lenovo has a simple design, often lightweight to be able to move easily in many places, giving it a modern, elegant feel. Some models also have a 360-degree folding hinge that can be easily rotated according to the needs of use.
The product has a high degree of sideability, especially if you use it for office tasks that don't require a lot of configuration, the machine can provide stable and powerful performance for 20 years.
Lenovo laptops are often cheap, suitable for students and office workers.
The level of image and sound display is only average, not too excellent. The Lenovo case is usually made of plastic that is not durable, and the machine is also easy to heat up if used continuously due to the poor heat dissipation base.
This is a computer brand for Gamer originating from the multinational technology company Micro-Star International with headquarters in New Taipei, Taiwan. This is the laptop line already available on 120 countries worldwide, famous for the world's best products, including quality, design, product performance...
Mid-range segment: such as GE uses the latest and most powerful technology such as the latest generation Intel core i (i5,i7) processors, high-performance HQ chips and optimized discrete graphics cards.
In addition, the GP, GV, and GL series in the mainstream segment offer better gaming, web and entertainment experiences than ever before.
The hinge of the MSI gaming laptop is designed with a beautiful black scratched aluminum cover, but the interior room is plastic. They are pressed together, so they are not very durable, easy to break the screws inside the hinge foothold.
Apple is the leading famous brand for laptops in the United States, with a variety of products and designs, suitable for all audiences from low-end to high-end. Apple's two best laptops to date.
So many Vietnamese people when using Macbook for the first time will find it a bit difficult, with the difference in keyboard shortcuts. However, if you have had time to learn, you will definitely love this device, because they operate smoothly and stably, especially when using iPhone and iPad sync right on MacBook.
Compared to laptops with similar configuration, the price of Macbook is often many times more expensive. This is also understandable because not only the product is invested in design and configuration, but also the outstanding high value of the Apple brand.
