The free DNS service offers various security features to prevent phishing attacks and content filtering, making it a great option for both home and personal use. OpenDNS supports IPv4 and IPV6 addresses and supports DoH but not DoT.
It has over 30 fast DNS servers located on different continents to provide transparent and faster DNS resolution in various parts of the world.
Quad9 does not filter content: only phishing or malware domains are blocked.
DNS with parental control: CleanBrowsing
