Imagine having to answer the same question over and over and over again. With bots, you can create an order that will automatically answer these repetitive questions.
Twitch bots can do a variety of things on Twitch, but the most common tasks they will accomplish will be moderating chat, organizing games, sweepstakes or polls, performing chat commands. and the answer to frequently asked questions in the chat.
One thing you should note is that each robot designed for specific, appropriate tasks is limited to those tasks. In other words, we must not forget that there is no such thing as a robot capable of thinking for itself.
