LEGOLAND Water Park is the part of Dubai Parks and Resorts, LEGOLAND Dubai and LEGOLAND Water Park are the ultimate year-round theme park destination in the Middle East for families with children from 2-12. LEGOLAND Dubai and LEGOLAND Water Park are hands-on experiences allowing families to take part in a full day LEGO-themed adventures through interactive rides, water slides, models and building experiences.
There are over 20 water slides and attractions for the family to enjoy together.
Spin down the slide on your own or with a friend on a double tube and enjoy endless twists and turns.
Speed down the 60-foot drop of this open body slide and ‘splash out’ into the water below.
Catch a gentle wave or simply cool off in this perfectly sized wave pool where the waves are just big enough for the whole family to enjoy.
Who can build the biggest, best LEGO® raft?
Imagine, design and build your own unique LEGO vessel and float around the lazy river.
