It’s a perfect place for a lazy afternoon or a blast of excitement, or keen to shred some waves, Laguna Waterpark offers something for those who like to explore new places and chill out with friends and family members. Laguna Waterpark features a water slide complex with five main rides, as well as a pool lounge, a children’s zone, and a lazy river.
This slide will take you on a heart-pounding free-fall journey straight down into the splashdown lane below.
Go with the flow on Laguna’s Lazy River and relax back as your tube is swept along the lazy river oasis, one that can be enjoyed by the entire family – but – watch out for the surprises along the way.
The perfect spot for young adventurers, Aqua Play is a super play structure with fun waterslides and giant “soaker” bucket. And plenty of fun for kids.
Jump aboard the circular raft and experience surprising twists and turns before dropping onto the massive manta wing and experiencing zero-gravity for a few seconds before you splash down in the pool below.
Nestled at the heart of Dubai’s coolest beachfront destination of La Mer in between panoramic views of the ocean and Dubai’s skyline, Laguna transports you to a carefree, seaside paradise where hours of fun can be had by the whole family. Park Timings
