Analysis of the development status of Sodium Metabisulfite industry in China in 2020: the market scale reaches 3.04 billion yuan
Intelligence research consulting released “2020-2026 China Sodium Metabisulfite industry present situation and the market potential investment attraction research report shows, in 2014 China Sodium Metabisulfite market size is 1.398 billion yuan, China Sodium Metabisulfite market scale growth in 2020 to 3.04 billion yuan, since 2014 China Sodium Metabisulfite market scale compound growth rate of 11.76%.
China is the largest producer and consumer of Sodium Metabisulfite, but there is still a gap between China’s Sodium Metabisulfite industry and foreign developed economies in terms of product technology and added value. In the future, enterprises in China’s Sodium Metabisulfite industry will still focus on improving product performance and strive to become a powerful country in the Sodium Metabisulfite industry as soon as possible.
