News - Why are more and more rural markets choosing miniature excavators?
Why are more and more rural markets choosing miniature excavators?
At present, with the development of science and technology, the agricultural construction has entered the era of mechanized operation. The micro excavator is very popular.
Price advantage. Because large excavators are expensive, miniature excavators have certain advantages in price, and their performance is not inferior to that of large excavators, and they consume less oil and are more economical.
Advantages in volume. When the medium and large excavators work in a narrow and complex environment, they can do nothing because of the large size, and the miniature excavator is small and mobile, can work in a small space, and is not affected by space limitations, so it is very popular.
High productivity. The rotating radius of the miniature excavator is small, so when the working space is limited, the operator does not need to consider the obstacles on the farm will hinder the rotation of the excavator, so as to focus more on the bucket operation, thus greatly enhancing the operating efficiency.
