I often find that other companies offering similar services get in touch to outsource this part of their process.
It works out well for both parties.
However, as someone who doesn't neglect human ethics in the business environment, I would recommend against such a practice. It wouldn't just cause unnecessary stress to you and your partners (or, at worst, drama), but it might hinder any future opportunities to build partnerships with other businesses.
You might find a solution together. If nothing works out, then you can separate on good terms, without hurting each other's reputation.
