Useful Tip: One quick way to do this is to click on the hosting company’s ToS link (usually at the bottom of homepage), press Ctrl + F, and search for keyword “renewal” or “renew”.
Note that usually hosting companies that slash their price at signup are the ones that jack up renewal price the most.
What is the hosting company’s refund policy after the trial period has ended?
These are some basic questions you should get the answers to before signing up.
There are some hosting companies that charge absurdly high cancellation fees when users cancel their accounts during trial periods. Our advice?
On the other hand, some hosting companies provide anytime money-back guarantees where you can ask for a pro-rated refund after your trial period is over (good eh? ).
